%!PS-Adobe-3.0
%%Title: Path subdivision with transform.inc - Chapter 8
%%Pages: 1
%%EndComments

(transform.inc) run
72 72 scale
2.5 4.5 translate
1 72 div setlinewidth
newpath
0 0 moveto
1 2 2 2 3 0 curveto
gsave 0.7 setgray stroke grestore
newpath
0 0 moveto
1 2 2 2 3 0 curveto
subdivide
0 setgray
stroke
showpage
%%EOF
